        "structure": "prove-general-divisibility",
        "solution_text": "Let $P(x)=x^n-1$.\n$P(1)=1^n-1$\n$=0$\n$P(1)=0$ for every positive integer $n$, so $(x-1)$ is a factor of $x^n-1$."
